Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.78,0:00:19.58,Default,,0,0,0,,好的 谢谢
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.84,0:00:22.98,Default,,0,0,0,,您紧张吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.40,0:00:27.74,Default,,0,0,0,,是的... 毕竟是第一次来这种高档店
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.26,0:00:30.32,Default,,0,0,0,,原来是这样啊
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.44,0:00:35.50,Default,,0,0,0,,因为工作取得了不错的成绩
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.38,0:00:37.72,Default,,0,0,0,,算是给自己的奖励吧
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.82,0:00:38.52,Default,,0,0,0,,也当作是纪念
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.74,0:00:40.96,Default,,0,0,0,,一直都想来一次看看
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.08,0:00:41.32,Default,,0,0,0,,这种地方
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.70,0:00:43.68,Default,,0,0,0,,是这样啊...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.22,0:00:46.62,Default,,0,0,0,,既然是第一次来
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.08,0:00:49.04,Default,,0,0,0,,选我这个新人真的可以吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.04,0:00:50.60,Default,,0,0,0,,啊 当然
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.16,0:00:54.38,Default,,0,0,0,,这里的女孩都非常漂亮
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.80,0:00:56.58,Default,,0,0,0,,能被您这样的人接待
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.78,0:00:57.48,Default,,0,0,0,,我很开心
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.22,0:01:02.44,Default,,0,0,0,,那么... 请允许我重新介绍一下
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.48,0:01:07.66,Default,,0,0,0,,我叫美奈
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.38,0:01:09.68,Default,,0,0,0,,请多多关照
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.40,0:01:16.98,Default,,0,0,0,,请多关照
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.18,0:01:20.80,Default,,0,0,0,,可以吻你吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.38,0:01:23.48,Default,,0,0,0,,当然...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.41,0:01:29.95,Default,,0,0,0,,请坐吧
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.95,0:01:30.45,Default,,0,0,0,,好的
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.03,0:01:33.91,Default,,0,0,0,,失礼了...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.54,0:02:32.42,Default,,0,0,0,,好的...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.40,0:02:44.78,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.30,0:02:59.10,Default,,0,0,0,,我好紧张...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.16,0:03:00.48,Default,,0,0,0,,是吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.48,0:03:03.66,Default,,0,0,0,,您的嘴唇好柔软...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.94,0:03:04.92,Default,,0,0,0,,好可爱
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.16,0:03:06.08,Default,,0,0,0,,啊 真的吗...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.72,0:03:12.32,Default,,0,0,0,,啊...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.54,0:03:19.34,Default,,0,0,0,,那个...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.36,0:03:21.16,Default,,0,0,0,,不习惯吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.54,0:03:22.94,Default,,0,0,0,,啊... 是的
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.26,0:03:23.36,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.21,0:03:54.21,Default,,0,0,0,,不好意思
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.21,0:03:58.11,Default,,0,0,0,,请躺下来... 我来为您涂润滑液...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.19,0:03:58.75,Default,,0,0,0,,把那个涂上去...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.75,0:04:00.37,Default,,0,0,0,,稍微涂一点可以吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.01,0:04:01.73,Default,,0,0,0,,好——的
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.22,0:04:25.62,Default,,0,0,0,,乳头... 感觉舒服吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.70,0:04:26.56,Default,,0,0,0,,很舒服...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.68,0:04:27.36,Default,,0,0,0,,太好了...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.94,0:04:38.36,Default,,0,0,0,,好舒服...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.36,0:04:39.20,Default,,0,0,0,,想吃...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.17,0:05:05.31,Default,,0,0,0,,好厉害... 变硬了呢
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.89,0:05:06.87,Default,,0,0,0,,不好意思...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.31,0:05:35.35,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯——
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.15,0:05:43.13,Default,,0,0,0,,请把腿张开...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.84,0:05:56.32,Default,,0,0,0,,真的很硬呢...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.62,0:05:57.54,Default,,0,0,0,,不好意思...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.36,0:05:59.28,Default,,0,0,0,,稍微有点...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.28,0:06:01.62,Default,,0,0,0,,看着您的脸的时候...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.62,0:06:03.14,Default,,0,0,0,,虽然我很紧张...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.36,0:06:06.20,Default,,0,0,0,,但是您的脸好帅气...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.19,0:06:25.71,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.96,0:06:34.44,Default,,0,0,0,,那个... 没关系吗？这里...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.14,0:06:37.72,Default,,0,0,0,,虽然我有好好清洗过...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.44,0:06:39.62,Default,,0,0,0,,没关系哦
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.58,0:06:43.44,Default,,0,0,0,,有好好清理过呢
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.44,0:06:43.96,Default,,0,0,0,,味道很好闻
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.84,0:06:56.26,Default,,0,0,0,,啊... 糟糕...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.78,0:07:01.62,Default,,0,0,0,,啊...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.16,0:07:36.54,Default,,0,0,0,,不行了...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.34,0:07:39.18,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.80,0:07:47.24,Default,,0,0,0,,请尽情兴奋起来吧
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.24,0:07:48.66,Default,,0,0,0,,不好意思... 真的很合我口味
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.06,0:07:49.86,Default,,0,0,0,,舒服吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.38,0:07:50.82,Default,,0,0,0,,是的！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.30,0:07:53.10,Default,,0,0,0,,前端舒服吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.93,0:08:28.99,Default,,0,0,0,,喉咙... 好像很浅呢...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.99,0:08:30.93,Default,,0,0,0,,啊哈哈哈... 怎么了？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.87,0:08:32.99,Default,,0,0,0,,啊哈哈哈！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.99,0:08:34.93,Default,,0,0,0,,啊 对不起...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.69,0:08:45.79,Default,,0,0,0,,不是那样的...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.79,0:08:46.33,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.55,0:08:48.35,Default,,0,0,0,,全都是舒服的地方...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.35,0:08:49.45,Default,,0,0,0,,呵呵呵...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.45,0:08:50.67,Default,,0,0,0,,你能感觉到吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.67,0:08:52.29,Default,,0,0,0,,因为你这么有反应...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.56,0:08:56.98,Default,,0,0,0,,好可爱...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.76,0:08:58.98,Default,,0,0,0,,再让我看看...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.98,0:09:01.80,Default,,0,0,0,,好... 好的...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.40,0:09:04.94,Default,,0,0,0,,呼... 呼...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.98,0:09:06.16,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.30,0:09:46.88,Default,,0,0,0,,请稍微休息一下...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.98,0:09:49.04,Default,,0,0,0,,你想看吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.06,0:09:51.92,Default,,0,0,0,,不好意思...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.14,0:09:52.88,Default,,0,0,0,,我想看...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.06,0:10:03.66,Default,,0,0,0,,好厉害... 好有感觉...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.23,0:10:22.49,Default,,0,0,0,,好舒服...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.73,0:10:25.25,Default,,0,0,0,,这个胸部...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.25,0:10:25.87,Default,,0,0,0,,舒服吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.03,0:10:27.37,Default,,0,0,0,,非常舒服...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.86,0:10:37.82,Default,,0,0,0,,好厉害...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.56,0:10:47.12,Default,,0,0,0,,非常舒服...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.97,0:10:53.71,Default,,0,0,0,,真的很厉害...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.31,0:10:57.15,Default,,0,0,0,,不好意思...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.77,0:11:00.51,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.94,0:11:19.24,Default,,0,0,0,,好舒服...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.24,0:11:25.54,Default,,0,0,0,,很柔软吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.58,0:11:28.60,Default,,0,0,0,,非常柔软...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.42,0:11:31.02,Default,,0,0,0,,软绵绵的...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.50,0:11:34.52,Default,,0,0,0,,我明白...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.30,0:12:00.54,Default,,0,0,0,,超——
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.76,0:12:06.34,Default,,0,0,0,,那种感觉...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.10,0:12:09.30,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.95,0:12:22.93,Default,,0,0,0,,糟糕了...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.27,0:12:35.37,Default,,0,0,0,,非常漂亮...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.28,0:12:58.20,Default,,0,0,0,,难受吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.38,0:12:59.64,Default,,0,0,0,,虽然有点难受...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.64,0:13:00.80,Default,,0,0,0,,但很幸福...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.44,0:13:02.26,Default,,0,0,0,,好深...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.43,0:13:20.57,Default,,0,0,0,,马上就又立起来了...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.66,0:13:37.40,Default,,0,0,0,,味道非常好闻...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.38,0:13:49.88,Default,,0,0,0,,紧张缓解了吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.92,0:13:51.68,Default,,0,0,0,,不好意思...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.86,0:13:54.44,Default,,0,0,0,,我现在非常兴奋...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.22,0:14:08.54,Default,,0,0,0,,已经很厉害了哦...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.98,0:15:11.70,Default,,0,0,0,,好硬...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.26,0:15:22.82,Default,,0,0,0,,全部都很舒服...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.74,0:15:26.86,Default,,0,0,0,,舒服吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.10,0:15:28.18,Default,,0,0,0,,很舒服...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.69,0:15:39.53,Default,,0,0,0,,这个... 会忍不住的...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.63,0:15:42.17,Default,,0,0,0,,要忍住哦...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.60,0:15:47.18,Default,,0,0,0,,这个动作...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.66,0:15:51.36,Default,,0,0,0,,就像要高潮了一样...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.36,0:15:51.68,Default,,0,0,0,,哈哈哈...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.68,0:16:04.04,Default,,0,0,0,,那么... 之后...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.32,0:16:06.42,Default,,0,0,0,,我们再做更多舒服的事吧...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.52,0:16:08.08,Default,,0,0,0,,好...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.20,0:16:09.92,Default,,0,0,0,,开心吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.06,0:16:10.70,Default,,0,0,0,,开心...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.90,0:16:13.48,Default,,0,0,0,,我会忍住的...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.48,0:16:15.12,Default,,0,0,0,,还要再忍耐一下哦...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.90,0:16:19.86,Default,,0,0,0,,糟糕了...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.76,0:16:38.92,Default,,0,0,0,,糟糕了...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.18,0:16:39.38,Default,,0,0,0,,不行了...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.58,0:16:41.30,Default,,0,0,0,,你没事吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.48,0:16:41.84,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.52,0:16:43.14,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯——
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.15,0:16:49.29,Default,,0,0,0,,可以一起舒服吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.87,0:16:51.59,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯... 好好好...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.94,0:17:01.56,Default,,0,0,0,,不好意思...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.68,0:17:02.46,Default,,0,0,0,,你一直在看呢...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.90,0:17:03.44,Default,,0,0,0,,呵呵呵...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.42,0:17:06.74,Default,,0,0,0,,你一直盯着看啊...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.94,0:17:07.60,Default,,0,0,0,,啊 不好意思...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.60,0:17:08.14,Default,,0,0,0,,呵呵呵...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.38,0:17:11.76,Default,,0,0,0,,啊... 你在拼命忍耐呢...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.76,0:17:12.92,Default,,0,0,0,,啊 对不起...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.32,0:17:15.62,Default,,0,0,0,,啊 厉害...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.82,0:17:16.62,Default,,0,0,0,,呵呵呵...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.00,0:17:17.64,Default,,0,0,0,,不好意思...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.74,0:17:18.50,Default,,0,0,0,,好害羞...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.54,0:17:20.72,Default,,0,0,0,,都拉丝了哦...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.10,0:17:22.16,Default,,0,0,0,,你在忍耐吧...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.26,0:17:22.84,Default,,0,0,0,,被发现了...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.24,0:17:36.74,Default,,0,0,0,,真的在拼命忍耐呢...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.56,0:17:39.30,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯——
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.00,0:17:47.68,Default,,0,0,0,,先一起舒服吧...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.92,0:17:50.32,Default,,0,0,0,,好...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.32,0:17:50.38,Default,,0,0,0,,好...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.02,0:17:51.92,Default,,0,0,0,,啊... 进来吧...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.16,0:17:52.64,Default,,0,0,0,,啊...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.62,0:18:04.98,Default,,0,0,0,,这里...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.18,0:18:06.26,Default,,0,0,0,,都湿透了...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.32,0:18:09.16,Default,,0,0,0,,那是... 什么东西呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.96,0:18:13.00,Default,,0,0,0,,不要太剧烈哦...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.28,0:18:15.84,Default,,0,0,0,,好...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.88,0:18:20.44,Default,,0,0,0,,啊...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.02,0:18:47.04,Default,,0,0,0,,舒服吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.58,0:18:48.34,Default,,0,0,0,,舒服吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.34,0:18:49.26,Default,,0,0,0,,哈哈...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.28,0:19:12.68,Default,,0,0,0,,啊...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.53,0:19:20.89,Default,,0,0,0,,啊... 啊...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.19,0:19:25.39,Default,,0,0,0,,前端很厉害吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.53,0:19:26.19,Default,,0,0,0,,请骑上来...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.73,0:19:28.53,Default,,0,0,0,,请再多忍耐一下...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.82,0:20:05.92,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.54,0:20:20.62,Default,,0,0,0,,喜欢的...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.06,0:20:31.90,Default,,0,0,0,,要怎么做呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.82,0:20:34.80,Default,,0,0,0,,我在稍微忍耐...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.31,0:20:36.86,Default,,0,0,0,,再稍微忍耐一下...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.10,0:20:53.00,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯... 快了... 快了...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.00,0:20:54.14,Default,,0,0,0,,啊 真的！！！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.97,0:21:05.23,Default,,0,0,0,,受不了了...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.83,0:21:06.45,Default,,0,0,0,,要去了？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.59,0:21:08.37,Default,,0,0,0,,好像要去了...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.96,0:21:13.02,Default,,0,0,0,,我会多舔你敏感的地方哦...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.98,0:21:18.54,Default,,0,0,0,,再多的话... 有点...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.94,0:21:35.52,Default,,0,0,0,,请好好让我看看...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.78,0:21:39.96,Default,,0,0,0,,可以吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.84,0:21:49.80,Default,,0,0,0,,忍到你能忍的极限...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.14,0:21:53.78,Default,,0,0,0,,不... 可是...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.52,0:22:03.98,Default,,0,0,0,,那个... 不行了...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.34,0:22:12.12,Default,,0,0,0,,真的忍不住啊...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.90,0:22:14.98,Default,,0,0,0,,太舒服了...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.70,0:22:18.78,Default,,0,0,0,,忍到你能忍的极限...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.98,0:22:20.78,Default,,0,0,0,,多让我看看...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.26,0:22:30.32,Default,,0,0,0,,糟了...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.40,0:22:30.90,Default,,0,0,0,,真的...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.50,0:22:32.92,Default,,0,0,0,,感觉要...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.04,0:22:45.42,Default,,0,0,0,,糟了... 真的...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.58,0:22:46.42,Default,,0,0,0,,要去了...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.56,0:22:48.68,Default,,0,0,0,,要去了哦...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.70,0:22:49.24,Default,,0,0,0,,要去了...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.90,0:22:51.54,Default,,0,0,0,,都要出来了哦！
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.54,0:22:53.74,Default,,0,0,0,,不行了... 忍不住了...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.16,0:22:55.60,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.06,0:22:56.84,Default,,0,0,0,,呃...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.84,0:22:57.82,Default,,0,0,0,,啊...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.82,0:22:58.86,Default,,0,0,0,,啊...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.86,0:23:00.24,Default,,0,0,0,,啊...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.10,0:23:02.50,Default,,0,0,0,,啊啊... 哈...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.37,0:23:14.73,Default,,0,0,0,,出来好多呢...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.25,0:23:15.63,Default,,0,0,0,,哈...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.64,0:23:34.14,Default,,0,0,0,,……
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.14,0:23:36.54,Default,,0,0,0,,哈...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.54,0:23:38.78,Default,,0,0,0,,哈...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.39,0:23:47.85,Default,,0,0,0,,哈...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.85,0:23:51.98,Default,,0,0,0,,哈...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:51.98,0:23:52.92,Default,,0,0,0,,不好意思...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:53.14,0:23:54.76,Default,,0,0,0,,实在是太舒服了...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:54.76,0:23:56.14,Default,,0,0,0,,哈...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:56.14,0:23:57.36,Default,,0,0,0,,太好了...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:58.02,0:24:00.50,Default,,0,0,0,,真的很舒服...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:00.70,0:24:01.80,Default,,0,0,0,,哈...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:02.36,0:24:03.78,Default,,0,0,0,,身材真好...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:04.70,0:24:06.36,Default,,0,0,0,,我还在兴奋着...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:07.38,0:24:08.18,Default,,0,0,0,,谢谢你...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:09.08,0:24:09.88,Default,,0,0,0,,那么...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:09.88,0:24:12.40,Default,,0,0,0,,时间还早...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:12.40,0:24:14.06,Default,,0,0,0,,你喜欢气垫玩法吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:24:15.16,0:24:15.96,Default,,0,0,0,,这里...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:15.96,0:24:17.92,Default,,0,0,0,,我喜欢...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:18.36,0:24:20.82,Default,,0,0,0,,那我们去气垫那边吧...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:20.82,0:24:22.36,Default,,0,0,0,,好...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:35.68,0:24:36.38,Default,,0,0,0,,失礼了...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:37.04,0:24:37.46,Default,,0,0,0,,雅小姐
Dialogue: 0,0:24:38.00,0:24:39.26,Default,,0,0,0,,请用二号房间
Dialogue: 0,0:24:39.66,0:24:41.00,Default,,0,0,0,,好——
Dialogue: 0,0:24:41.00,0:24:41.94,Default,,0,0,0,,呐...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:41.94,0:24:43.60,Default,,0,0,0,,下个月开始可以改名字吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:24:44.20,0:24:45.20,Default,,0,0,0,,啊 可以是可以
Dialogue: 0,0:24:45.38,0:24:46.00,Default,,0,0,0,,是因为你老公吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:24:46.50,0:24:47.96,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:47.96,0:24:51.34,Default,,0,0,0,,是啊 好像被怀疑了...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:51.34,0:24:53.84,Default,,0,0,0,,虽然发照片日记时也不露脸
Dialogue: 0,0:24:54.14,0:24:55.00,Default,,0,0,0,,不过以防万一...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:55.78,0:24:56.38,Default,,0,0,0,,我知道了
Dialogue: 0,0:24:56.86,0:24:57.48,Default,,0,0,0,,辛苦了
Dialogue: 0,0:24:58.64,0:25:00.10,Default,,0,0,0,,唉...
Dialogue: 0,0:25:02.24,0:25:04.62,Default,,0,0,0,,平时都不管我
Dialogue: 0,0:25:04.82,0:25:06.78,Default,,0,0,0,,这种时候才来查探 真烦人啊
Dialogue: 0,0:25:07.48,0:25:09.30,Default,,0,0,0,,诶 你们家那位也会这样吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:25:10.00,0:25:11.26,Default,,0,0,0,,啊 你好像是结婚了吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:25:11.26,0:25:14.76,Default,,0,0,0,,啊 我们家那口子好像完全没兴趣
Dialogue: 0,0:25:15.26,0:25:16.64,Default,,0,0,0,,哼...
Dialogue: 0,0:25:16.64,0:25:17.32,Default,,0,0,0,,诶 但是啊
Dialogue: 0,0:25:17.64,0:25:20.56,Default,,0,0,0,,你有不露脸拍照写日记吧
Dialogue: 0,0:25:21.80,0:25:23.56,Default,,0,0,0,,诶 男人可是很常看这种东西的哦
Dialogue: 0,0:25:23.66,0:25:24.88,Default,,0,0,0,,就算是不对风俗感兴趣的人也会看
Dialogue: 0,0:25:25.66,0:25:27.68,Default,,0,0,0,,是... 这样吗
Dialogue: 0,0:25:27.68,0:25:29.22,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯...
Dialogue: 0,0:25:29.22,0:25:32.38,Default,,0,0,0,,所以啊 要趁着还是新人时赶紧赚一笔
Dialogue: 0,0:25:32.82,0:25:34.02,Default,,0,0,0,,然后赶紧辞掉比较好
Dialogue: 0,0:25:35.40,0:25:36.24,Default,,0,0,0,,是啊
Dialogue: 0,0:25:36.98,0:25:38.10,Default,,0,0,0,,趁还是新人的时候啊
Dialogue: 0,0:25:38.44,0:25:40.60,Default,,0,0,0,,店里会优先安排指名客人给你
Dialogue: 0,0:25:42.48,0:25:42.84,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:25:43.38,0:25:45.30,Default,,0,0,0,,所以啊 现在是你该努力的时候
Dialogue: 0,0:25:46.28,0:25:46.64,Default,,0,0,0,,谢谢你
Dialogue: 0,0:26:07.81,0:26:08.61,Default,,0,0,0,,我开动了
Dialogue: 0,0:26:17.18,0:26:19.16,Default,,0,0,0,,(独白) 我丈夫在外地单独赴任
Dialogue: 0,0:26:19.34,0:26:22.24,Default,,0,0,0,,结婚后我几乎一直一个人生活
Dialogue: 0,0:26:23.60,0:26:27.96,Default,,0,0,0,,正当我以为婚姻生活大概就是这样的时候
Dialogue: 0,0:26:28.80,0:26:31.00,Default,,0,0,0,,我从朋友那听说后开始做的
Dialogue: 0,0:26:32.62,0:26:33.64,Default,,0,0,0,,是在风俗店的兼职工作
Dialogue: 0,0:26:43.03,0:26:44.61,Default,,0,0,0,,那确实挺寂寞的啊
Dialogue: 0,0:26:45.23,0:26:46.79,Default,,0,0,0,,诶 但收入应该不错吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:26:47.59,0:26:48.27,Default,,0,0,0,,哪里哪里
Dialogue: 0,0:26:48.65,0:26:50.15,Default,,0,0,0,,我这算是普通水平
Dialogue: 0,0:26:50.77,0:26:51.47,Default,,0,0,0,,是吗——
Dialogue: 0,0:26:51.83,0:26:54.75,Default,,0,0,0,,诶 但做兼职也还能过得去吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:26:55.55,0:26:55.57,Default,,0,0,0,,诶？
Dialogue: 0,0:26:56.37,0:26:57.27,Default,,0,0,0,,那就是说
Dialogue: 0,0:26:57.99,0:26:59.73,Default,,0,0,0,,你其实挺喜欢做这种事的吧
Dialogue: 0,0:27:00.03,0:27:01.15,Default,,0,0,0,,不是这样的...
Dialogue: 0,0:27:01.79,0:27:02.45,Default,,0,0,0,,诶——？
Dialogue: 0,0:27:03.07,0:27:05.31,Default,,0,0,0,,我是因为对老公不满
Dialogue: 0,0:27:05.69,0:27:07.25,Default,,0,0,0,,所以才在这里释放性欲的...
Dialogue: 0,0:27:08.03,0:27:08.49,Default,,0,0,0,,不好意思
Dialogue: 0,0:27:09.07,0:27:10.13,Default,,0,0,0,,各位 拜托了
Dialogue: 0,0:27:10.63,0:27:11.41,Default,,0,0,0,,啊 知道了
Dialogue: 0,0:27:12.45,0:27:12.91,Default,,0,0,0,,啊 大家
Dialogue: 0,0:27:13.25,0:27:13.81,Default,,0,0,0,,在互相确认时间呢...
Dialogue: 0,0:27:13.81,0:27:15.15,Default,,0,0,0,,啊 谢谢你
Dialogue: 0,0:27:16.71,0:27:17.61,Default,,0,0,0,,不 我也是啊
Dialogue: 0,0:27:17.79,0:27:20.15,Default,,0,0,0,,就这样戴着戒指出现在客人面前
Dialogue: 0,0:27:20.61,0:27:21.35,Default,,0,0,0,,已经和客人睡过了
Dialogue: 0,0:27:21.39,0:27:22.75,Default,,0,0,0,,如果被发现的话 真的很麻烦
Dialogue: 0,0:27:23.25,0:27:23.97,Default,,0,0,0,,所以要注意啊
Dialogue: 0,0:27:24.33,0:27:25.07,Default,,0,0,0,,好的 谢谢
Dialogue: 0,0:27:25.85,0:27:26.59,Default,,0,0,0,,慢走...
Dialogue: 0,0:27:26.59,0:27:27.13,Default,,0,0,0,,打扰了...
Dialogue: 0,0:27:30.23,0:27:31.67,Default,,0,0,0,,啊 您又来了啊...
Dialogue: 0,0:27:32.33,0:27:33.77,Default,,0,0,0,,您最近工作很顺利呢...
Dialogue: 0,0:27:34.55,0:27:35.19,Default,,0,0,0,,啊 是的...
Dialogue: 0,0:27:36.47,0:27:39.87,Default,,0,0,0,,而且... 我也想着还想再见您...
Dialogue: 0,0:27:41.57,0:27:43.51,Default,,0,0,0,,没想到您真的会再来...
Dialogue: 0,0:27:43.67,0:27:44.49,Default,,0,0,0,,我很开心...
Dialogue: 0,0:27:45.87,0:27:46.71,Default,,0,0,0,,不好意思...
Dialogue: 0,0:27:46.75,0:27:46.75,Default,,0,0,0,,让您破费了...
Dialogue: 0,0:27:47.15,0:27:49.25,Default,,0,0,0,,因为我想和您再在一起...
Dialogue: 0,0:27:49.57,0:27:50.33,Default,,0,0,0,,就来了...
Dialogue: 0,0:27:53.31,0:27:57.21,Default,,0,0,0,,我也一直想着还想再见您呢...
Dialogue: 0,0:27:59.57,0:28:00.47,Default,,0,0,0,,真的吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:28:01.19,0:28:01.75,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯...
Dialogue: 0,0:28:59.05,0:29:00.67,Default,,0,0,0,,那就... 请到这里...
Dialogue: 0,0:29:13.08,0:29:15.50,Default,,0,0,0,,我先从背后开始为您洗哦...
Dialogue: 0,0:29:15.80,0:29:16.78,Default,,0,0,0,,好的 拜托了
Dialogue: 0,0:29:49.67,0:29:50.93,Default,,0,0,0,,柔软吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:29:51.59,0:29:51.79,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯...
Dialogue: 0,0:29:53.73,0:29:55.45,Default,,0,0,0,,我觉得非常柔软...
Dialogue: 0,0:30:04.09,0:30:05.61,Default,,0,0,0,,我来给您洗脚吧...
Dialogue: 0,0:30:06.55,0:30:06.73,Default,,0,0,0,,好...
Dialogue: 0,0:30:24.46,0:30:25.52,Default,,0,0,0,,好舒服...
Dialogue: 0,0:30:48.58,0:30:50.28,Default,,0,0,0,,脸靠得这么近有点害羞呢...
Dialogue: 0,0:30:51.62,0:30:52.66,Default,,0,0,0,,害羞吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:30:53.46,0:30:54.46,Default,,0,0,0,,害羞...
Dialogue: 0,0:31:08.64,0:31:09.86,Default,,0,0,0,,好舒服...
Dialogue: 0,0:31:32.04,0:31:34.12,Default,,0,0,0,,我能感觉到在旁边摩擦...
Dialogue: 0,0:31:35.68,0:31:37.20,Default,,0,0,0,,能感觉到碰到了吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:31:37.74,0:31:38.64,Default,,0,0,0,,能感觉到...
Dialogue: 0,0:31:48.38,0:31:49.40,Default,,0,0,0,,那就转过来吧...
Dialogue: 0,0:31:49.82,0:31:50.76,Default,,0,0,0,,我会抬起来哦...
Dialogue: 0,0:31:51.42,0:31:51.54,Default,,0,0,0,,好...
Dialogue: 0,0:32:33.56,0:32:34.26,Default,,0,0,0,,我拿来了...
Dialogue: 0,0:32:34.50,0:32:35.36,Default,,0,0,0,,如果要接吻的话...
Dialogue: 0,0:32:35.42,0:32:35.96,Default,,0,0,0,,我会拿掉口罩的...
Dialogue: 0,0:32:35.96,0:32:37.06,Default,,0,0,0,,呵呵...
Dialogue: 0,0:32:44.26,0:32:45.96,Default,,0,0,0,,您的吻很舒服...
Dialogue: 0,0:32:48.84,0:32:49.28,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯...
Dialogue: 0,0:33:01.98,0:33:02.56,Default,,0,0,0,,很舒服...
Dialogue: 0,0:33:02.96,0:33:04.22,Default,,0,0,0,,让我近距离看看...
Dialogue: 0,0:34:04.76,0:34:05.52,Default,,0,0,0,,不好意思...
Dialogue: 0,0:34:11.00,0:34:11.62,Default,,0,0,0,,不好意思...
Dialogue: 0,0:34:11.84,0:34:12.62,Default,,0,0,0,,很舒服...
Dialogue: 0,0:34:54.51,0:34:55.77,Default,,0,0,0,,非常舒服...
Dialogue: 0,0:35:03.72,0:35:05.14,Default,,0,0,0,,滑溜溜地就逃掉了呢...
Dialogue: 0,0:35:07.84,0:35:09.54,Default,,0,0,0,,但是滑滑的很舒服...
Dialogue: 0,0:35:12.10,0:35:14.76,Default,,0,0,0,,软软的滑滑的很舒服...
Dialogue: 0,0:36:00.57,0:36:01.01,Default,,0,0,0,,好厉害...
Dialogue: 0,0:36:01.01,0:36:02.67,Default,,0,0,0,,大家可能会这么想...
Dialogue: 0,0:36:02.79,0:36:04.23,Default,,0,0,0,,摩擦得很激烈...
Dialogue: 0,0:36:06.15,0:36:07.23,Default,,0,0,0,,很容易摩擦呢...
Dialogue: 0,0:36:11.71,0:36:12.85,Default,,0,0,0,,黏糊糊的...
Dialogue: 0,0:36:12.85,0:36:13.39,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯——
Dialogue: 0,0:36:50.48,0:36:52.46,Default,,0,0,0,,您的身体让我很舒服...
Dialogue: 0,0:36:52.70,0:36:53.46,Default,,0,0,0,,舒服吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:37:15.51,0:37:17.57,Default,,0,0,0,,沾满泡泡的胸部...
Dialogue: 0,0:37:18.87,0:37:20.55,Default,,0,0,0,,果然很想看啊...
Dialogue: 0,0:37:20.55,0:37:21.59,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯——
Dialogue: 0,0:37:43.82,0:37:45.08,Default,,0,0,0,,有好好洗干净吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:37:46.50,0:37:47.56,Default,,0,0,0,,洗得很干净了...
Dialogue: 0,0:37:49.86,0:37:51.94,Default,,0,0,0,,但是会变得很舒服...
Dialogue: 0,0:37:52.36,0:37:52.50,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯——
Dialogue: 0,0:37:52.98,0:37:53.98,Default,,0,0,0,,有点变硬了...
Dialogue: 0,0:38:14.59,0:38:16.41,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯——
Dialogue: 0,0:38:18.65,0:38:28.12,Default,,0,0,0,,5分钟？
Dialogue: 0,0:38:44.92,0:38:46.32,Default,,0,0,0,,我明白了... 马上就好了...
Dialogue: 0,0:38:52.10,0:38:52.44,Default,,0,0,0,,哇...
Dialogue: 0,0:38:56.78,0:38:57.70,Default,,0,0,0,,变得硬硬的了...
Dialogue: 0,0:39:57.87,0:39:58.85,Default,,0,0,0,,会有感觉的...
Dialogue: 0,0:40:00.43,0:40:01.41,Default,,0,0,0,,想要放进去...
Dialogue: 0,0:40:06.15,0:40:06.49,Default,,0,0,0,,哦！
Dialogue: 0,0:40:25.61,0:40:28.59,Default,,0,0,0,,变得干干净净了呢...
Dialogue: 0,0:40:29.65,0:40:30.17,Default,,0,0,0,,是的...
Dialogue: 0,0:40:41.04,0:40:44.26,Default,,0,0,0,,那我们去冲一下吧...
Dialogue: 0,0:40:45.38,0:40:45.68,Default,,0,0,0,,好的...
Dialogue: 0,0:42:05.00,0:42:06.42,Default,,0,0,0,,哇 恢复精神了...
Dialogue: 0,0:42:07.32,0:42:08.48,Default,,0,0,0,,又变硬了...
Dialogue: 0,0:42:14.38,0:42:15.76,Default,,0,0,0,,可以吃吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:42:16.98,0:42:17.64,Default,,0,0,0,,可以含住吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:42:26.22,0:42:27.50,Default,,0,0,0,,厉害... 立起来了...
Dialogue: 0,0:43:08.62,0:43:10.02,Default,,0,0,0,,这个会立起来...
Dialogue: 0,0:43:10.02,0:43:13.38,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯...
Dialogue: 0,0:43:28.80,0:43:30.52,Default,,0,0,0,,是您敏感的地方吧...
Dialogue: 0,0:43:31.88,0:43:33.38,Default,,0,0,0,,与其说敏感...
Dialogue: 0,0:43:33.54,0:43:36.14,Default,,0,0,0,,不如说是喜欢...
Dialogue: 0,0:43:36.14,0:43:37.82,Default,,0,0,0,,被发现了啊...
Dialogue: 0,0:43:38.84,0:43:40.00,Default,,0,0,0,,之前我就记住了...
Dialogue: 0,0:43:43.15,0:43:45.05,Default,,0,0,0,,但是... 您还记得我...
Dialogue: 0,0:43:45.45,0:43:46.49,Default,,0,0,0,,我很开心...
Dialogue: 0,0:43:47.37,0:43:48.67,Default,,0,0,0,,当然了...
Dialogue: 0,0:43:48.67,0:43:51.87,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯...
Dialogue: 0,0:44:02.65,0:44:03.91,Default,,0,0,0,,啊 舒服...
Dialogue: 0,0:44:25.24,0:44:26.06,Default,,0,0,0,,你舔的时候...
Dialogue: 0,0:44:26.38,0:44:28.38,Default,,0,0,0,,脸变得很色气...
Dialogue: 0,0:45:11.74,0:45:12.42,Default,,0,0,0,,喜欢这个吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:18.29,0:45:20.35,Default,,0,0,0,,好舒服...
Dialogue: 0,0:45:33.92,0:45:38.12,Default,,0,0,0,,感觉要去了...
Dialogue: 0,0:45:38.12,0:45:38.92,Default,,0,0,0,,要去了么?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:39.66,0:45:40.14,Default,,0,0,0,,啊...
Dialogue: 0,0:45:40.14,0:45:41.96,Default,,0,0,0,,可以... 射出来吗...
Dialogue: 0,0:46:04.22,0:46:06.32,Default,,0,0,0,,出来好多呢...
Dialogue: 0,0:46:07.30,0:46:08.52,Default,,0,0,0,,不好意思...
Dialogue: 0,0:46:08.70,0:46:09.62,Default,,0,0,0,,好可爱...
Dialogue: 0,0:46:11.24,0:46:12.36,Default,,0,0,0,,好厉害...
Dialogue: 0,0:46:12.36,0:46:14.20,Default,,0,0,0,,量好大...
Dialogue: 0,0:46:17.50,0:46:19.06,Default,,0,0,0,,还能再来一次吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:20.68,0:46:22.04,Default,,0,0,0,,我还想要...
Dialogue: 0,0:46:22.20,0:46:23.78,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯...
Dialogue: 0,0:46:23.78,0:46:25.06,Default,,0,0,0,,那我们再来一次吧...
Dialogue: 0,0:46:25.40,0:46:25.90,Default,,0,0,0,,好...
Dialogue: 0,0:47:22.46,0:47:24.30,Default,,0,0,0,,用手指...
Dialogue: 0,0:47:24.58,0:47:26.50,Default,,0,0,0,,我去洗一下身体...
Dialogue: 0,0:47:26.88,0:47:27.48,Default,,0,0,0,,好...
Dialogue: 0,0:47:46.91,0:47:47.83,Default,,0,0,0,,已经很舒服了...
Dialogue: 0,0:47:48.29,0:47:50.75,Default,,0,0,0,,啊 好厉害...
Dialogue: 0,0:48:04.14,0:48:05.26,Default,,0,0,0,,好滑啊...
Dialogue: 0,0:48:06.02,0:48:06.92,Default,,0,0,0,,舒服吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:48:07.18,0:48:08.38,Default,,0,0,0,,很舒服...
Dialogue: 0,0:48:43.87,0:48:45.11,Default,,0,0,0,,滑滑的...
Dialogue: 0,0:49:16.98,0:49:18.64,Default,,0,0,0,,不会太刺激吗？？
Dialogue: 0,0:49:18.64,0:49:22.85,Default,,0,0,0,,很舒服...
Dialogue: 0,0:49:23.59,0:49:26.49,Default,,0,0,0,,啊... 乳头...
Dialogue: 0,0:50:03.49,0:50:24.63,Default,,0,0,0,,我这边也去冲洗一下哦...
Dialogue: 0,0:50:25.43,0:50:25.89,Default,,0,0,0,,好...
Dialogue: 0,0:51:21.58,0:51:22.38,Default,,0,0,0,,在滑动...
Dialogue: 0,0:51:25.96,0:51:27.38,Default,,0,0,0,,很舒服呢...
Dialogue: 0,0:52:39.11,0:52:40.07,Default,,0,0,0,,哦 肩膀后面...
Dialogue: 0,0:52:42.75,0:52:44.85,Default,,0,0,0,,你知道我在用胸部贴着吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:52:45.31,0:52:45.67,Default,,0,0,0,,知道...
Dialogue: 0,0:52:53.96,0:52:55.44,Default,,0,0,0,,胸部的形状也...
Dialogue: 0,0:52:55.44,0:52:57.26,Default,,0,0,0,,乳头的形状也能感觉到...
Dialogue: 0,0:53:27.82,0:53:34.05,Default,,0,0,0,,然后腿也清理一下哦...
Dialogue: 0,0:53:34.35,0:53:39.83,Default,,0,0,0,,现在正在舔哦...
Dialogue: 0,0:53:42.59,0:53:44.05,Default,,0,0,0,,哇 好舒服...
Dialogue: 0,0:53:53.01,0:53:53.87,Default,,0,0,0,,糟了...
Dialogue: 0,0:53:54.43,0:53:55.71,Default,,0,0,0,,像是被吸住一样...
Dialogue: 0,0:54:03.26,0:54:04.42,Default,,0,0,0,,一直到最里面...
Dialogue: 0,0:54:15.91,0:54:17.13,Default,,0,0,0,,不怕痒吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:54:17.13,0:54:18.63,Default,,0,0,0,,不... 觉得很舒服...
Dialogue: 0,0:55:04.76,0:55:06.48,Default,,0,0,0,,你也能感觉到乳头吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:55:26.07,0:55:27.61,Default,,0,0,0,,美绪真的是在瞄准敏感点啊...
Dialogue: 0,0:55:28.07,0:55:29.31,Default,,0,0,0,,全部都很舒服...
Dialogue: 0,0:55:56.52,0:55:59.00,Default,,0,0,0,,好害羞...
Dialogue: 0,0:55:59.92,0:56:00.76,Default,,0,0,0,,害羞吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:56:01.16,0:56:02.22,Default,,0,0,0,,这个姿势...
Dialogue: 0,0:56:02.38,0:56:03.40,Default,,0,0,0,,而且...
Dialogue: 0,0:56:30.38,0:56:33.10,Default,,0,0,0,,有点害羞但很舒服...
Dialogue: 0,0:56:48.05,0:56:49.77,Default,,0,0,0,,这个真的很好哦...
Dialogue: 0,0:56:49.77,0:56:50.41,Default,,0,0,0,,啊〜...
Dialogue: 0,0:57:05.21,0:57:06.69,Default,,0,0,0,,果然是这样... 果然...
Dialogue: 0,0:57:23.26,0:57:24.48,Default,,0,0,0,,要去了吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:57:31.49,0:57:32.49,Default,,0,0,0,,好害羞〜
Dialogue: 0,0:57:40.05,0:57:44.37,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯 等一下...
Dialogue: 0,0:57:44.43,0:57:44.87,Default,,0,0,0,,肉棒...
Dialogue: 0,0:57:46.57,0:57:49.97,Default,,0,0,0,,肚子... 贴上去了...
Dialogue: 0,0:57:52.11,0:57:55.43,Default,,0,0,0,,不是很厉害吗...
Dialogue: 0,0:58:26.69,0:58:22.69,Default,,0,0,0,,不管哪种都很舒服...
Dialogue: 0,0:58:43.82,0:58:44.90,Default,,0,0,0,,手指...
Dialogue: 0,0:58:49.08,0:58:51.50,Default,,0,0,0,,终于... 终于啊...
Dialogue: 0,0:58:52.40,0:58:54.08,Default,,0,0,0,,好害羞...
Dialogue: 0,0:58:58.37,0:58:59.45,Default,,0,0,0,,好厉害呢...
Dialogue: 0,0:59:17.17,0:59:19.35,Default,,0,0,0,,很舒服...
Dialogue: 0,0:59:20.27,0:59:22.41,Default,,0,0,0,,舒服得有点不正常了...
Dialogue: 0,0:59:22.79,0:59:23.37,Default,,0,0,0,,好怕...
Dialogue: 0,0:59:24.09,0:59:24.65,Default,,0,0,0,,好可爱...
Dialogue: 0,0:59:53.94,0:59:56.44,Default,,0,0,0,,让我舔一下吧...
Dialogue: 0,1:00:00.01,1:00:01.77,Default,,0,0,0,,可以给我吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:00:02.69,1:00:04.91,Default,,0,0,0,,可以让我为您口交吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:00:12.98,1:00:14.16,Default,,0,0,0,,很舒服...
Dialogue: 0,1:00:24.89,1:00:27.03,Default,,0,0,0,,这种黏糊糊的感觉... 真的很色...
Dialogue: 0,1:00:29.07,1:00:30.61,Default,,0,0,0,,太让人沉醉了...
Dialogue: 0,1:00:59.16,1:01:00.48,Default,,0,0,0,,我想进去...
Dialogue: 0,1:01:01.92,1:01:02.92,Default,,0,0,0,,你想进去吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:01:02.92,1:01:04.14,Default,,0,0,0,,我想进去...
Dialogue: 0,1:01:10.72,1:01:12.06,Default,,0,0,0,,虽然很舒服...
Dialogue: 0,1:01:12.54,1:01:13.24,Default,,0,0,0,,你想插进来吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:01:13.44,1:01:14.24,Default,,0,0,0,,我想插进去...
Dialogue: 0,1:01:15.90,1:01:16.32,Default,,0,0,0,,还没...
Dialogue: 0,1:01:23.00,1:01:24.26,Default,,0,0,0,,但是这个很舒服...
Dialogue: 0,1:01:50.33,1:01:51.71,Default,,0,0,0,,舒服得有点奇怪...
Dialogue: 0,1:01:58.82,1:02:01.40,Default,,0,0,0,,屁股...
Dialogue: 0,1:02:06.77,1:02:11.23,Default,,0,0,0,,这个姿势可以吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:02:17.33,1:02:18.21,Default,,0,0,0,,好厉害...
Dialogue: 0,1:03:07.79,1:03:11.67,Default,,0,0,0,,是的...
Dialogue: 0,1:03:25.62,1:03:27.48,Default,,0,0,0,,很舒服...
Dialogue: 0,1:03:31.34,1:03:32.14,Default,,0,0,0,,请看...
Dialogue: 0,1:03:32.36,1:03:33.32,Default,,0,0,0,,那个很危险...
Dialogue: 0,1:04:03.08,1:04:03.98,Default,,0,0,0,,舒服吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:04:04.68,1:04:06.76,Default,,0,0,0,,太舒服了...
Dialogue: 0,1:04:08.26,1:04:11.36,Default,,0,0,0,,刚刚出来了又马上要去了...
Dialogue: 0,1:04:11.36,1:04:12.72,Default,,0,0,0,,请加油...
Dialogue: 0,1:04:13.58,1:04:15.12,Default,,0,0,0,,还不行...
Dialogue: 0,1:04:32.42,1:04:34.04,Default,,0,0,0,,那是什么...
Dialogue: 0,1:04:36.11,1:04:37.16,Default,,0,0,0,,犯规...
Dialogue: 0,1:06:52.51,1:06:54.33,Default,,0,0,0,,可以从后面进来吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:07:37.62,1:07:38.74,Default,,0,0,0,,我们之后再继续吧...
Dialogue: 0,1:17:26.98,1:17:28.36,Default,,0,0,0,,辛苦了...
Dialogue: 0,1:17:28.62,1:17:29.10,Default,,0,0,0,,我是篠原...
Dialogue: 0,1:17:35.08,1:17:37.20,Default,,0,0,0,,我打算先回公司一趟...
Dialogue: 0,1:17:43.62,1:17:44.70,Default,,0,0,0,,是要谈话吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:17:46.20,1:17:47.02,Default,,0,0,0,,我明白了...
Dialogue: 0,1:17:47.94,1:17:49.54,Default,,0,0,0,,我想16点能回来...
Dialogue: 0,1:17:58.59,1:17:59.93,Default,,0,0,0,,(电话/对话结束后) 不知道要谈什么呢？
Dialogue: 0,1:18:06.03,1:18:08.67,Default,,0,0,0,,篠原先生... 今天你能来我很高兴...
Dialogue: 0,1:18:11.51,1:18:12.53,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么了？
Dialogue: 0,1:18:18.27,1:18:23.47,Default,,0,0,0,,其实... 我要被调职到福冈去了...
Dialogue: 0,1:18:23.47,1:18:28.11,Default,,0,0,0,,福冈... 可真远啊...
Dialogue: 0,1:18:29.11,1:18:29.75,Default,,0,0,0,,是的...
Dialogue: 0,1:18:31.35,1:18:37.55,Default,,0,0,0,,所以... 这可能是最后一次见到你了...
Dialogue: 0,1:18:39.25,1:18:41.33,Default,,0,0,0,,也许是这样呢...
Dialogue: 0,1:18:46.69,1:18:53.45,Default,,0,0,0,,所以... 请把今天当作最后一次来做... 可以吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:20:20.88,1:20:22.42,Default,,0,0,0,,很舒服...
Dialogue: 0,1:20:42.18,1:20:45.12,Default,,0,0,0,,明明我已经这么喜欢你了...
Dialogue: 0,1:20:45.20,1:20:47.34,Default,,0,0,0,,好寂寞啊...
Dialogue: 0,1:20:56.36,1:20:57.58,Default,,0,0,0,,我也很寂寞...
Dialogue: 0,1:21:10.49,1:21:11.75,Default,,0,0,0,,好舒服...
Dialogue: 0,1:23:44.07,1:23:45.23,Default,,0,0,0,,我也很寂寞...
Dialogue: 0,1:23:58.00,1:23:58.70,Default,,0,0,0,,想到你会寂寞地离去...
Dialogue: 0,1:23:58.70,1:23:59.58,Default,,0,0,0,,我觉得有点害怕...
Dialogue: 0,1:24:00.42,1:24:02.84,Default,,0,0,0,,我想让你感到舒服...
Dialogue: 0,1:26:02.48,1:26:04.40,Default,,0,0,0,,希望能感受到我的心情...
Dialogue: 0,1:26:34.86,1:26:36.52,Default,,0,0,0,,阴茎的感觉...
Dialogue: 0,1:26:36.52,1:26:38.10,Default,,0,0,0,,感觉到了...
Dialogue: 0,1:27:36.33,1:27:37.47,Default,,0,0,0,,很舒服...
Dialogue: 0,1:27:37.47,1:27:39.05,Default,,0,0,0,,很舒服...
Dialogue: 0,1:27:39.05,1:27:41.41,Default,,0,0,0,,我也很舒服...
Dialogue: 0,1:27:51.77,1:27:53.25,Default,,0,0,0,,只是摩擦着...
Dialogue: 0,1:27:54.05,1:27:55.63,Default,,0,0,0,,就很舒服...
Dialogue: 0,1:28:38.65,1:28:41.09,Default,,0,0,0,,还不行...
Dialogue: 0,1:28:50.60,1:28:51.78,Default,,0,0,0,,啊啊...
Dialogue: 0,1:28:51.78,1:28:55.08,Default,,0,0,0,,啊啊啊...
Dialogue: 0,1:29:18.10,1:29:20.52,Default,,0,0,0,,好像进入了深处...
Dialogue: 0,1:29:21.20,1:29:22.52,Default,,0,0,0,,舒服吗?
Dialogue: 0,1:29:22.84,1:29:26.02,Default,,0,0,0,,啊啊啊...
Dialogue: 0,1:30:16.12,1:30:16.24,Default,,0,0,0,,那个...
Dialogue: 0,1:30:16.82,1:30:19.36,Default,,0,0,0,,呵呵... 我可以任性地去高潮吗?
Dialogue: 0,1:30:19.64,1:30:20.66,Default,,0,0,0,,什... 什么?
Dialogue: 0,1:30:21.72,1:30:23.70,Default,,0,0,0,,呃... 那个...
Dialogue: 0,1:30:23.70,1:30:30.52,Default,,0,0,0,,想用肉棒摩擦的话... 可以的哦...
Dialogue: 0,1:30:39.09,1:30:39.43,Default,,0,0,0,,可以吗?
Dialogue: 0,1:31:03.10,1:31:08.24,Default,,0,0,0,,很舒服... 你喜欢这个吗?
Dialogue: 0,1:31:08.34,1:31:09.32,Default,,0,0,0,,是的...
Dialogue: 0,1:31:30.28,1:31:31.96,Default,,0,0,0,,啊 糟了...
Dialogue: 0,1:31:34.32,1:31:35.88,Default,,0,0,0,,舒服...
Dialogue: 0,1:31:41.68,1:31:44.66,Default,,0,0,0,,啊 不行了...
Dialogue: 0,1:31:49.19,1:31:53.27,Default,,0,0,0,,好像要出来了...
Dialogue: 0,1:31:54.27,1:31:56.31,Default,,0,0,0,,啊 糟了...
Dialogue: 0,1:31:59.85,1:32:02.93,Default,,0,0,0,,啊 要去了... 要去了...
Dialogue: 0,1:32:41.34,1:32:43.10,Default,,0,0,0,,出来好多呢...
Dialogue: 0,1:32:44.72,1:32:46.52,Default,,0,0,0,,对不起...
Dialogue: 0,1:32:46.52,1:32:49.58,Default,,0,0,0,,只有我... 变得很舒服...
Dialogue: 0,1:32:49.58,1:32:50.44,Default,,0,0,0,,哈哈...
Dialogue: 0,1:32:55.17,1:32:59.03,Default,,0,0,0,,哈...
Dialogue: 0,1:33:47.96,1:33:49.40,Default,,0,0,0,,真的很寂寞...
Dialogue: 0,1:33:49.64,1:33:51.70,Default,,0,0,0,,真的吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:33:53.68,1:33:55.28,Default,,0,0,0,,虽然身体是...
Dialogue: 0,1:34:22.08,1:34:23.50,Default,,0,0,0,,你的身体...
Dialogue: 0,1:34:23.66,1:34:24.30,Default,,0,0,0,,很舒服...
Dialogue: 0,1:34:27.04,1:34:28.40,Default,,0,0,0,,别说这种（伤感的）话...
Dialogue: 0,1:34:30.06,1:34:30.82,Default,,0,0,0,,对不起...
Dialogue: 0,1:35:12.64,1:35:13.34,Default,,0,0,0,,哈...
Dialogue: 0,1:35:27.67,1:35:28.75,Default,,0,0,0,,可以看看吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:36:04.76,1:36:06.88,Default,,0,0,0,,啊... 啊！
Dialogue: 0,1:36:14.54,1:36:16.28,Default,,0,0,0,,啊……啊……
Dialogue: 0,1:36:45.20,1:36:47.46,Default,,0,0,0,,这里？是这里吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:36:47.46,1:36:47.96,Default,,0,0,0,,是吗...
Dialogue: 0,1:36:57.35,1:36:58.53,Default,,0,0,0,,你这里...
Dialogue: 0,1:36:58.77,1:37:01.03,Default,,0,0,0,,真的好紧致...
Dialogue: 0,1:37:01.03,1:37:03.89,Default,,0,0,0,,啊—啊 好舒服...
Dialogue: 0,1:37:43.68,1:37:44.86,Default,,0,0,0,,舒服吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:38:10.80,1:38:12.78,Default,,0,0,0,,想让你变得很舒服呢...
Dialogue: 0,1:39:00.53,1:39:02.13,Default,,0,0,0,,接下来换我（动）...
Dialogue: 0,1:39:24.89,1:39:27.19,Default,,0,0,0,,因为你让我很舒服...
Dialogue: 0,1:39:27.37,1:39:29.12,Default,,0,0,0,,我也...
Dialogue: 0,1:39:34.79,1:39:36.13,Default,,0,0,0,,好舒服...
Dialogue: 0,1:39:52.11,1:39:55.19,Default,,0,0,0,,想和你一起变得舒服...
Dialogue: 0,1:39:55.63,1:39:56.83,Default,,0,0,0,,要多做一点哦...
Dialogue: 0,1:40:25.70,1:40:27.18,Default,,0,0,0,,好舒服...
Dialogue: 0,1:40:51.32,1:40:54.06,Default,,0,0,0,,明明想做很多次...
Dialogue: 0,1:40:58.92,1:41:00.86,Default,,0,0,0,,明明想一次又一次地做...
Dialogue: 0,1:41:02.66,1:41:03.58,Default,,0,0,0,,但是...
Dialogue: 0,1:41:04.12,1:41:05.60,Default,,0,0,0,,这可能是最后一次了吧？
Dialogue: 0,1:41:08.52,1:41:09.44,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯...
Dialogue: 0,1:41:09.44,1:41:10.74,Default,,0,0,0,,好难受...
Dialogue: 0,1:41:45.67,1:41:47.39,Default,,0,0,0,,对不起...
Dialogue: 0,1:41:50.33,1:41:51.47,Default,,0,0,0,,你的身体...
Dialogue: 0,1:41:51.69,1:41:52.17,Default,,0,0,0,,真的...
Dialogue: 0,1:41:52.65,1:41:54.03,Default,,0,0,0,,全部都很舒服...
Dialogue: 0,1:42:13.01,1:42:14.51,Default,,0,0,0,,像要融化了一样...
Dialogue: 0,1:42:15.65,1:42:16.53,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯...
Dialogue: 0,1:42:21.94,1:42:23.14,Default,,0,0,0,,一直... 一直...
Dialogue: 0,1:42:23.34,1:42:24.10,Default,,0,0,0,,很舒服...
Dialogue: 0,1:42:26.32,1:42:27.42,Default,,0,0,0,,好开心...
Dialogue: 0,1:43:37.86,1:43:41.04,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯... 全部...
Dialogue: 0,1:43:43.00,1:43:44.14,Default,,0,0,0,,一直很舒服...
Dialogue: 0,1:45:25.84,1:45:28.50,Default,,0,0,0,,已经不行了...
Dialogue: 0,1:45:29.02,1:45:30.08,Default,,0,0,0,,好像要刺穿了...
Dialogue: 0,1:45:32.12,1:45:35.16,Default,,0,0,0,,想射进去...
Dialogue: 0,1:45:35.62,1:45:37.16,Default,,0,0,0,,一直都想射进去...
Dialogue: 0,1:45:45.09,1:45:46.13,Default,,0,0,0,,射进去？
Dialogue: 0,1:45:47.53,1:45:48.49,Default,,0,0,0,,想射进去...
Dialogue: 0,1:46:36.91,1:46:38.31,Default,,0,0,0,,很舒服...
Dialogue: 0,1:47:44.76,1:47:45.56,Default,,0,0,0,,哦... 哦...
Dialogue: 0,1:48:40.08,1:48:45.90,Default,,0,0,0,,啊... 啊...
Dialogue: 0,1:48:53.20,1:48:53.76,Default,,0,0,0,,哇...
Dialogue: 0,1:49:11.06,1:49:12.40,Default,,0,0,0,,好舒服...
Dialogue: 0,1:49:13.48,1:49:16.74,Default,,0,0,0,,好开心...
Dialogue: 0,1:49:20.84,1:49:23.20,Default,,0,0,0,,篠原先生... 太舒服了...
Dialogue: 0,1:49:53.25,1:49:55.25,Default,,0,0,0,,最深处被顶到了...
Dialogue: 0,1:52:53.54,1:53:13.22,Default,,0,0,0,,太厉害了... 好舒服啊... 啊...
Dialogue: 0,1:54:32.22,1:54:34.00,Default,,0,0,0,,很痛苦（因为要分别）...
Dialogue: 0,1:58:15.14,1:58:16.44,Default,,0,0,0,,请全部射给我...
Dialogue: 0,2:03:37.24,2:03:38.90,Default,,0,0,0,,我喜欢你...
Dialogue: 0,2:03:38.90,2:03:41.94,Default,,0,0,0,,我也喜欢!!
Dialogue: 0,2:03:41.94,2:03:42.92,Default,,0,0,0,,喜欢!!
Dialogue: 0,2:05:01.55,2:05:02.27,Default,,0,0,0,,喜欢...
Dialogue: 0,2:05:06.80,2:05:07.92,Default,,0,0,0,,我也喜欢...
Dialogue: 0,2:05:57.98,2:06:00.64,Default,,0,0,0,,最后一次做爱感觉好吗?
Dialogue: 0,2:06:04.04,2:06:04.44,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯...
Dialogue: 0,2:06:06.36,2:06:07.02,Default,,0,0,0,,很棒...
Dialogue: 0,2:06:18.02,2:06:20.36,Default,,0,0,0,,那个... 我...
Dialogue: 0,2:06:20.94,2:06:22.72,Default,,0,0,0,,真的很喜欢你...
Dialogue: 0,2:06:26.18,2:06:27.20,Default,,0,0,0,,所以...
Dialogue: 0,2:06:27.20,2:06:27.54,Default,,0,0,0,,对不起...
Dialogue: 0,2:06:30.14,2:06:31.64,Default,,0,0,0,,我已经结婚了...
Dialogue: 0,2:06:34.06,2:06:34.42,Default,,0,0,0,,诶?
Dialogue: 0,2:06:35.88,2:06:38.00,Default,,0,0,0,,不过我老公在外地单身赴任
Dialogue: 0,2:06:39.34,2:06:41.66,Default,,0,0,0,,一直没能说出口 对不起
Dialogue: 0,2:06:48.37,2:06:49.19,Default,,0,0,0,,你丈夫呢...
Dialogue: 0,2:06:49.61,2:06:50.91,Default,,0,0,0,,关于这份工作的事
Dialogue: 0,2:06:51.13,2:06:52.35,Default,,0,0,0,,他知道吗?
Dialogue: 0,2:06:52.35,2:06:56.51,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯... 与其说不知道...
Dialogue: 0,2:06:57.13,2:06:59.13,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯... 我觉得他对我不感兴趣...
Dialogue: 0,2:07:02.75,2:07:03.83,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么会这样...
Dialogue: 0,2:07:05.13,2:07:07.49,Default,,0,0,0,,所以啊 篠原君能来找我
Dialogue: 0,2:07:07.69,2:07:08.75,Default,,0,0,0,,我很开心
Dialogue: 0,2:07:09.69,2:07:11.57,Default,,0,0,0,,如此心意相通的性爱...
Dialogue: 0,2:07:11.99,2:07:13.17,Default,,0,0,0,,这还是第一次...
Dialogue: 0,2:08:06.13,2:08:08.77,Default,,0,0,0,,(半年后)
Dialogue: 0,2:08:10.11,2:08:13.07,Default,,0,0,0,,婚姻生活依然冷淡如初...
Dialogue: 0,2:08:13.97,2:08:17.93,Default,,0,0,0,,风俗的兼职做得越多 内心的寂寞就越加深
Dialogue: 0,2:08:19.27,2:08:21.67,Default,,0,0,0,,即便如此 我不辞职的理由只有一个...
Dialogue: 0,2:08:47.59,2:08:48.39,Default,,0,0,0,,我是美奈...
Dialogue: 0,2:08:48.99,2:08:49.95,Default,,0,0,0,,请多关照...
Dialogue: 0,2:09:02.68,2:09:04.24,Default,,0,0,0,,篠原君...?
Dialogue: 0,2:09:04.24,2:09:06.30,Default,,0,0,0,,美奈... 好久不见...
Dialogue: 0,2:09:07.72,2:09:09.14,Default,,0,0,0,,你回东京了？
Dialogue: 0,2:09:10.54,2:09:10.94,Default,,0,0,0,,是的
Dialogue: 0,2:09:11.74,2:09:14.28,Default,,0,0,0,,从下个月开始我又可以在这边工作了
Dialogue: 0,2:09:15.62,2:09:16.42,Default,,0,0,0,,这样啊...
Dialogue: 0,2:09:17.74,2:09:18.66,Default,,0,0,0,,不过话说回来...
Dialogue: 0,2:09:18.94,2:09:19.80,Default,,0,0,0,,美奈你真厉害啊...
Dialogue: 0,2:09:20.74,2:09:22.72,Default,,0,0,0,,居然在店里排进了榜单...
Dialogue: 0,2:09:24.32,2:09:25.12,Default,,0,0,0,,我一直在等你...
Dialogue: 0,2:09:26.08,2:09:27.16,Default,,0,0,0,,一直在等篠原君...
Dialogue: 0,2:09:27.86,2:09:28.44,Default,,0,0,0,,一直...
Dialogue: 0,2:09:30.92,2:09:31.58,Default,,0,0,0,,美奈...
Dialogue: 0,2:09:32.98,2:09:33.94,Default,,0,0,0,,叫我... 希娜
Dialogue: 0,2:09:35.44,2:09:36.68,Default,,0,0,0,,这是我真正的名字...
Dialogue: 0,2:09:40.88,2:09:41.60,Default,,0,0,0,,希娜小姐...
Dialogue: 0,2:09:41.60,2:09:41.88,Default,,0,0,0,,希娜...
Dialogue: 0,2:11:36.73,2:11:37.45,Default,,0,0,0,,真舒服...
Dialogue: 0,2:13:42.20,2:13:43.26,Default,,0,0,0,,一直喜欢你...
Dialogue: 0,2:13:43.80,2:13:44.92,Default,,0,0,0,,一直喜欢你...
Dialogue: 0,2:13:45.86,2:13:46.70,Default,,0,0,0,,我也是...
Dialogue: 0,2:14:16.48,2:14:18.50,Default,,0,0,0,,我也喜欢你...
Dialogue: 0,2:14:23.21,2:14:24.25,Default,,0,0,0,,我想听听那份工作的情况...
Dialogue: 0,2:17:16.64,2:17:18.00,Default,,0,0,0,,不准看别处哦...
Dialogue: 0,2:19:10.57,2:19:12.65,Default,,0,0,0,,果然...
Dialogue: 0,2:19:13.05,2:19:14.09,Default,,0,0,0,,真舒服...
Dialogue: 0,2:19:14.73,2:19:15.97,Default,,0,0,0,,呼—— 一直在等着...
Dialogue: 0,2:19:17.83,2:19:19.21,Default,,0,0,0,,一直想见你...
Dialogue: 0,2:19:53.59,2:19:54.43,Default,,0,0,0,,要脱掉了哦...
Dialogue: 0,2:20:29.60,2:20:30.84,Default,,0,0,0,,好喜欢希娜小姐...
Dialogue: 0,2:20:32.12,2:20:33.50,Default,,0,0,0,,我喜欢希娜小姐...
Dialogue: 0,2:20:35.96,2:20:37.48,Default,,0,0,0,,希娜小姐... 不行了...
Dialogue: 0,2:21:03.66,2:21:05.84,Default,,0,0,0,,很久没这样了吧？
Dialogue: 0,2:21:05.98,2:21:06.40,Default,,0,0,0,,是的...
Dialogue: 0,2:21:44.05,2:21:44.97,Default,,0,0,0,,我想要你做...
Dialogue: 0,2:21:45.87,2:21:47.89,Default,,0,0,0,,也想要希娜小姐的...
Dialogue: 0,2:22:00.62,2:22:01.48,Default,,0,0,0,,我喜欢你...
Dialogue: 0,2:22:07.10,2:22:08.12,Default,,0,0,0,,好舒服...
Dialogue: 0,2:22:22.86,2:22:26.96,Default,,0,0,0,,希娜...
Dialogue: 0,2:22:31.69,2:22:34.71,Default,,0,0,0,,希娜小姐... 好舒服... 好开心...
Dialogue: 0,2:22:36.13,2:22:37.25,Default,,0,0,0,,我很开心...
Dialogue: 0,2:22:37.61,2:22:38.43,Default,,0,0,0,,对不起...
Dialogue: 0,2:22:38.93,2:22:41.45,Default,,0,0,0,,我现在非常兴奋...
Dialogue: 0,2:22:48.13,2:22:49.17,Default,,0,0,0,,我也是...
Dialogue: 0,2:23:36.85,2:23:38.37,Default,,0,0,0,,非常舒服...
Dialogue: 0,2:23:39.09,2:23:40.89,Default,,0,0,0,,我也觉得胸部很舒服...
Dialogue: 0,2:23:42.41,2:23:43.69,Default,,0,0,0,,是篠原君的（肉棒）...
Dialogue: 0,2:23:45.63,2:23:46.67,Default,,0,0,0,,很舒服哦...
Dialogue: 0,2:24:10.05,2:24:11.73,Default,,0,0,0,,这里是你敏感的地方吧？
Dialogue: 0,2:24:13.79,2:24:14.59,Default,,0,0,0,,不是...
Dialogue: 0,2:24:15.45,2:24:16.63,Default,,0,0,0,,是我喜欢的地方...
Dialogue: 0,2:24:32.55,2:24:37.35,Default,,0,0,0,,好厉害... 越来越大...
Dialogue: 0,2:24:49.33,2:24:51.77,Default,,0,0,0,,一开始我想在希娜小姐里面...
Dialogue: 0,2:24:51.89,2:24:53.33,Default,,0,0,0,,想要射出来...
Dialogue: 0,2:25:39.18,2:25:39.92,Default,,0,0,0,,能进去吗？
Dialogue: 0,2:25:41.30,2:25:42.54,Default,,0,0,0,,我想进去...
Dialogue: 0,2:25:43.50,2:25:44.00,Default,,0,0,0,,进来吧...
Dialogue: 0,2:28:48.78,2:28:52.92,Default,,0,0,0,,一直都想这样呢...
Dialogue: 0,2:28:52.94,2:29:01.90,Default,,0,0,0,,我也是... 我也是啊...
Dialogue: 0,2:30:00.12,2:30:01.40,Default,,0,0,0,,保持这样...
Dialogue: 0,2:32:11.00,2:32:12.22,Default,,0,0,0,,要去了！
Dialogue: 0,2:32:12.72,2:32:13.40,Default,,0,0,0,,要去了！
Dialogue: 0,2:32:29.94,2:32:30.86,Default,,0,0,0,,等一下！
Dialogue: 0,2:32:31.56,2:32:32.18,Default,,0,0,0,,啊 喜欢！
Dialogue: 0,2:32:33.32,2:32:33.84,Default,,0,0,0,,我要去了！
Dialogue: 0,2:32:49.81,2:32:51.45,Default,,0,0,0,,啊——呜呜...
Dialogue: 0,2:33:24.80,2:33:25.92,Default,,0,0,0,,射出来了！
Dialogue: 0,2:34:57.47,2:34:58.45,Default,,0,0,0,,好热...
Dialogue: 0,2:39:53.84,2:39:55.08,Default,,0,0,0,,因为很舒服...
Dialogue: 0,2:39:56.14,2:39:57.48,Default,,0,0,0,,因为很兴奋...
Dialogue: 0,2:41:00.14,2:41:01.76,Default,,0,0,0,,我一生都不会忘记...
Dialogue: 0,2:41:02.39,2:41:04.02,Default,,0,0,0,,我不会忘记的...
Dialogue: 0,2:41:05.08,2:41:06.38,Default,,0,0,0,,今后也...
Dialogue: 0,2:46:34.95,2:46:40.31,Default,,0,0,0,,从那以后... 我和篠原先生在店外也开始见面了
Dialogue: 0,2:46:42.09,2:46:43.87,Default,,0,0,0,,未来的事我不知道...
Dialogue: 0,2:46:45.19,2:46:50.47,Default,,0,0,0,,但是... 现在我只想被这份幸福包围着...
Dialogue: 0,2:46:53.91,2:46:54.57,Default,,0,0,0,,希娜小姐！
Dialogue: 0,2:46:56.65,2:46:57.37,Default,,0,0,0,,不好意思...
Dialogue: 0,2:46:57.47,2:46:58.07,Default,,0,0,0,,让你久等了
Dialogue: 0,2:46:58.21,2:46:59.05,Default,,0,0,0,,完全没关系
Dialogue: 0,2:46:59.31,2:47:00.15,Default,,0,0,0,,我也是刚到
Dialogue: 0,2:47:00.15,2:47:00.89,Default,,0,0,0,,真的吗？
Dialogue: 0,2:47:01.47,2:47:02.57,Default,,0,0,0,,今天不热吗？
Dialogue: 0,2:47:02.73,2:47:03.53,Default,,0,0,0,,很热呢〜
Dialogue: 0,2:47:04.49,2:47:05.39,Default,,0,0,0,,有点出汗了...
Dialogue: 0,2:47:05.55,2:47:08.15,Default,,0,0,0,,我也是... 刚才一直在等的时候就有点出汗了
Dialogue: 0,2:47:08.55,2:47:09.49,Default,,0,0,0,,没迷路吧？
Dialogue: 0,2:47:09.59,2:47:09.77,Default,,0,0,0,,没事吧？
Dialogue: 0,2:47:09.83,2:47:10.37,Default,,0,0,0,,没事的
Dialogue: 0,2:47:10.95,2:47:12.19,Default,,0,0,0,,那我们去凉快一下吧
Dialogue: 0,2:47:12.31,2:47:12.53,Default,,0,0,0,,那边...
Dialogue: 0,2:47:12.81,2:47:13.43,Default,,0,0,0,,走吗...

